                        "username": "harshit-aghera"
                    },
                    "message": "Where should we add additional configuration property related to SMA, for example if we need a configuration property for nvidia-gpu application that we cannot obtain from MCTP VDM commands?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "platform_configurations/nvidia/mgx_connectx8_supernic_switch_server.json",
                    "line": 6,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Deepak Kodihalli",
                        "email": "deepak.kodihalli.83@gmail.com",
                        "username": "dkodihal"
                    },
                    "message": "We can certainly add it in the platform config; there's just no need in this commit."
                },
                {
                    "file": "platform_configurations/nvidia/mgx_connectx8_supernic_switch_server.json",
                    "line": 9,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Harshit Aghera",
                        "email": "haghera@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "harshit-aghera"
                    },
                    "message": "Do this Board corresponds to SMA? If no then should that Board have configuration related to SMA? And if it corresponds to the GPU (a bridged endpoint) then should we need one Board property for each BridgedEndpoint item that is added in the next commit?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "platform_configurations/nvidia/mgx_connectx8_supernic_switch_server.json",
                    "line": 9,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Deepak Kodihalli",
                        "email": "deepak.kodihalli.83@gmail.com",
                        "username": "dkodihal"
                    },
                    "message": "This corresponds to SMA and GPU, and yes the next commit introduces bridged endpoints."
                },
                {
                    "file": "platform_configurations/nvidia/mgx_connectx8_supernic_switch_server.json",
                    "line": 9,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Harshit Aghera",
                        "email": "haghera@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "harshit-aghera"
                    },
                    "message": "Correct me if I'm wrong, but strictly speaking, isn't this SMA located on Board `Nvidia IMGX ConnectX8 SuperNIC Switch` as oppose to pluggable GPU Board? If yes shouldn't this be `Nvidia IMGX ConnectX8 SuperNIC Switch` instead?\n\nFor a case when an associated Entity (one pointed by Board property) has more than one configuration under its exposes section, to identify the configuration applicable to this particular SMA, should we make `Board` an object. Then, `BridgedEndpoints` property in the next commit would be array of `Board` objects. `Name` property of the `Board` object would be used by dbus-sensors applications to correctly identify applicable configuration exposed by associated Entity.\n\n```\n\"Board\": {\n    \"Entity\": \"Nvidia IMGX ConnectX8 SuperNIC Switch\",\n    \"Name\": \"GPU 7 SMA\"\n}\n\n```"
                },
